	 "actors.buffs.combo$combomove.crush.empower_desc": "_Leaps up to {0} tile(s)_ and deals {1}% (combo*25%) damage to the primary target, and half that damage to all other enemies in a 7x7 AOE. Resets combo when used.",
	 "actors.buffs.combo$combomove.crush.name": "crush",
	 "actors.buffs.combo$combomove.fury.desc": "Hits an enemy once for each combo you have, each hit deals 60% damage and can trigger enchantments. Resets combo when used.",
	 "actors.buffs.combo$combomove.fury.empower_desc": "_Leaps up to {0} tile(s)_ and hits an enemy once for each combo you have, each hit deals 60% damage and can trigger enchantments. Resets combo when used.",
