	 "items.rings.ringofsharpshooting.combined_stats": "Your equipped rings are combining their power, boosting effective thrown weapon level by _{0}_ and increasing their durability by _{1}%_ in total.",
	 "items.rings.ringofsharpshooting.desc": "This ring enhances the wearer's precision and aim, which will make all projectile weapons more damaging and durable. A cursed ring will have the opposite effect.",
	 "items.rings.ringofsharpshooting.name": "ring of sharpshooting",
	 "items.rings.ringofsharpshooting.stats": "When worn, this ring will boost the damage of your thrown weapons as if their level was increased by _{0}_, and will increase their durability by _{1}%._",
