	 "items.weapon.melee.battleaxe.ability_desc": "The Duelist can perform a _heavy blow_ with a battle axe. This concentrated attack deals _{0}-{1} damage_ if it surprised the enemy, and dazes them for 5 turns which reduces accuracy and evasion by 50%. Heavy blow always hits but deals regular damage if it does not surprise the enemy.",
