	 "items.weapon.melee.gauntlet.ability_desc": "The Duelist can perform a _combo strike_ with a stone gauntlet. This attack is guaranteed to hit and deals _+{0} damage_ for each time the Duelist has hit with a regular melee or thrown weapon attack. Not hitting for 5 turns resets this combo.",
