	 "items.potions.exotic.potionofcleansing$cleanse.desc": "這個單位暫時免疫所有負面效果!\n\n免疫剩餘{0}回合。",
	 "items.potions.exotic.potionofcleansing$cleanse.name": "完全淨化",
